~ vorkoth_spare_novius_intervenes
astryn: (lowering the pistol) ...No. You're not worth it.

# She holsters the weapon and turns her back, walking toward the team.

vorkoth_p2: (a wet, ragged laugh from behind her) ...Mercy. From you.

# In one last surge, dark energy flares around Vorkoth's collapsed form. He lunges.

# Novius is already moving. He's on Vorkoth before anyone can shout a warning, driving his blade through him from the side.

# Vorkoth collapses fully this time, unmoving. Silence.

astryn: (breathless, staring) ...Nov.

novius: (not looking away from Vorkoth's body, quiet) I told you. I know exactly what he costs people.

astryn: ...Thank you.

novius: (finally looking at her) Don't spare men like him again.

# Astryn nods, shaken. The screen fades to black.

