~ vorkoth_spare
astryn: (lowering the pistol) ...No. You're not worth it.

# She holsters the weapon and turns her back, walking away from him.

vorkoth_p2: (a wet, ragged laugh from behind her) ...Mercy. From you.

# In one last surge, dark energy flares around Vorkoth's collapsed form. He lunges, driving a blade of dark magic through her back.

# Cut immediately to black.

vorkoth_p2: (shouting, distant, echoing) YOU SEE?! You see what happens to those who think they can challenge me?!

vorkoth_p2: Levaris does not bow to radicals! Let this "Justice" nonsense die with her!

# Silence again.

