~ duel_intro
PAAnnouncer: (booming, echoing) Ladies and gentlemen of Levaris! Tonight, in accordance with the challenge issued at this morning's podium, we bring you a duel for the ages!

PAAnnouncer: In this corner — the undisputed, unbroken defender of this city, the People's General himself — VORKOTH!

(The crowd cheers, though a little too on cue, a little too rehearsed.)

PAAnnouncer: And challenging him tonight... representing themselves as...

PAAnnouncer: (squinting at a piece of paper) ..."The Merciless Blades of Absolute Justice"?

(Silence. Astryn, Novius, and Aegrandir all turn to look at Spero.)

astryn: The what.

novius: Please tell me that's a joke.

aegrandir: (rubbing his temple) ...Spero.

spero: (already grinning) One of the guards asked me what to call us for the announcement. Someone had to answer.

astryn: And you said THAT.

spero: In my defense, "The Justice Bros" was my second choice.

novius: That's WORSE.

vorkoth_p1: (calling from across the Pit, delighted) The Merciless Blades of Absolute Justice! Wonderful. Truly. I almost don't want to embarrass you.

astryn: (through gritted teeth) I'm breaking your jaw after this, Spero.

spero: Noted. After we win.
=> END
